OL,3,GNEWSARecycling centre fire prompts
OL,4,Abattery warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire caused by a battery which was
OL,7,Fincorrectly discarded in a skip led to
OL,8,Fa recycling centre being evacuated, a
OL,9,Fcouncil said.
OL,11,FStaff at Kenilworth's Cherry Orchard
OL,12,Fwaste and recycling centre spotted
OL,13,Fsmoke and flames coming from a waste
OL,14,Fskip on Sunday.
OL,16,FFirefighters were called to the small
OL,17,Ffire which "had quickly spread to a
OL,18,Fneighbouring skip containing
OL,19,Fcardboard," said the county council.
