OL,3,GNEWSARecycling centre fire prompts
OL,4,Abattery warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey added that further investigations
OL,7,Ffound a member of the public had put a
OL,8,Frechargeable lithium-ionb@/battery into
OL,9,Fa black bag with other household waste.
OL,10,FThey urged people to put used batteries
OL,11,Fand vapes in dedicated containers at
OL,12,Fits centres.
